>The Angry Chef: Bad Science and the Truth about Healthy Eating"é
ãE Alike, suggrapheas taxidiotikon biblion apophasizei na paei sten Australia gia na brei ten aderphe tes, arkhaiologo, e opoia ekhei exaphanistei musteriodos kata te diarkeia epaggelmatikou taxidiou. Mone kai anuperaspiste anagkazetai na zetesei te boetheia tou proen antra tes, Kebin o opoios einai petukhemenos exereunetes kai ergazetai se ena apo ta megalutera kanalia tes khoras pragmatopoiontas ntokimanter se epikindunes periokhes. Poso eukole omos tha einai e sunuparxe xana me ekeinon ton antra pou einai apisteuta goeteutikos, pathiasmenos kai akome eroteumenos mazi tes; Kai poso akindune otan ki aute ekhei ta idia me ekeinon sunaisthemata;"ë
é"The popular understanding of nutrition is clouded by superstitions, primitive intuitions, conspiracy theories, and old wives' tales. This irreverent and intelligent expose brings sanity and good sense to one of life's great pleasures." --Steven Pinker, author of Angels of Our Better Nature
Never before have we had so much information available to us about food and health. There's GAPS, paleo, detox, gluten-free, alkaline, the sugar conspiracy, clean eating... Unfortunately, a lot of it is not only wrong but actually harmful. So why do so many of us believe this bad science?
Assembling a crack team of psychiatrists, behavioural economists, food scientists and dietitians, the Angry Chef unravels the mystery of why sensible, intelligent people are so easily taken in by the latest food fads, making brief detours for an expletive-laden rant. At the end of it all you'll have the tools to spot pseudoscience for yourself and the Angry Chef will be off for a nice cup of tea - and it will have two sugars in it, thank you very much."¨
©Ena panoramiko poluprosopo muthistorema, me kuriarkho stoikheio to gunaikeio sumpan, ta oikogeneiaka stegana kai to baru phortio pou klerodotei e mia genia sten alle.
To khroniko mias oikogeneias kentemeno ston kamba tes Thessalonikiotikes topiographias apo tous Balkanikous Polemous os te Diktatoria. Ephta gunaikes kai mia e aphegetria okhto diegountai tis polutarakhes diadromes tous. Tesseris genies mesa sto kokkino saloni anametran ki anametriountai, kanoun apologismo ton pathon kai ton lathon tous, thutes kai thumata sugkhronos, aphenoun ta phantasmata na bgoun ap' ten ntoulapa, anasurontas sten epiphaneia skoteina mustika. Ti semainei to diamantenio Alpha;
Ta istorika gegonota paizoun kruphto me te muthoplasia, kai oi eroides sumporeuontai me ten Istoria, te mikre kathemerine tes poles, alla kai ten eurutere tes Elladas, mplekontai sta granazia tes kai bionoun ta adiexoda tes. Parapaioun anamesa stis epitages tes kardias kai tou kormiou tous kai stous koinonikous sumbibasmous. Pegainoun kontra sto reuma, gdernontai, matonoun, alla de bouliazoun."µ
≤Konstantinoupole, 1536. O Ioannes Notaras straggalizetai epeide phugadeuse to gio tou Nikephoro sten Enetokratoumene Kerkura, anti na ton paradosei sto soultano Souleiman gia na ikanopoiei tis orexeis tou.
Ki eno e gunaika kai e kore tou Notara odegountai sto kharemi, ta paralia tes Mesogeiou leelatountai apo ton arkhipeirate Mparmparossa.
Se auto to istoriko plaisio xetuligetai mia sunarpastike aphegese opou e istoria kai o muthos sunduazontai me tropo monadiko, prospherontas mas ena axekhasto muthistorema. Mia ode ston erota se sunthese Giorgou Polurake."À
»Ena kheimoniatiko sabbatokuriako se mia ereme parathalassia loutropole stenetai ena skeniko prodosias, anatropon kai katharses. Enas prodomenos erastes, duo basanismenoi kalogeroi, enas dianooumenos-tsigganos kai mia monophthalme metanastria. Piso apo olous autous, mia gunaika, phoreas tes Nosou ton Eraston, -allote thutes kai allote thuma tes- pou kinei ta nemata kai krataei tis apanteseis. Moires agnoston pou sundeontai anapantekha, khronies pleges pou kleinoun sphragismenes apo aprosmenes philies ki enas erotas, o opoios sernei ap' ten arkhe os to telos to stigma tes perionumes astheneias.Drama kharakteron, istoria musteriou kai mia askese pano stis anthropines skheseis... ola auta mazi. Os to telos."ÿ
’Paris. In einem Labor wird ein Wissenschaftler grausam hingerichtet.
Uganda. In einem Krankenhaus sterben Menschen an einer ratselhaften Gehirnkrankheit.
Rouen. Im Gefangnis sagt eine Umweltaktivistin eine schreckliche Katastrophe voraus.
All dies ist erst der Anfang eines Geschehens, das das Leben auf der Erde fur immer verandern soll ..."‰
·Mia nukhta tha stathei e aphorme gia na anatrapei e zoe duo adelphon, tes Keit kai tes Khana Koneli, otan mia ekrexe katastrephei oloskheros ten oikogeneiake epikheirese pou dieuthunei o pateras tous. Stis stakhtes krubontai polles upopsies kai erotematika... Eprokeito gia empresmo; Ti douleia eikhe ekei e Keit mazi me ton Gkas, suntaxiodotemeno pleon ergazomeno tes epikheireses, te nukhta tes ekrexes;
Tora o Gkas einai nekros, e Keit se koma, kai kanenas apo tous duo den mporei na dosei exegeseis* oute na proeidopoiesei oti kapoios, etoimos akoma kai gia phono, mporei aplos na kaluptei ta ikhne tou..."Ë
ÂO Antones Kokkinos gennietai ena mesemeri katameses enos khoraphiou kapou sten Epeiro, te mera pou xespaei mia agria kataigida. Treis meres meta e mana tou xepsukhaei apo epiplokes tes gennas. Apo ekeine te stigme o pateras tou arneitai na ton dei. Megalonei apo te megale tou adelphe, steremenos apo goneis.
Dekapentakhrono paidi pheugei apo to khorio tou gia ten Amerike me to oneiro na kanei polla lephta. E zoe omos den tou kharizetai. Douleuei sklera, apo paidi gia thelemata mekhri mparman sto periphemo klamp Stountio 54 tes Neas Uorkes, gia na katalexei na poulaei erota se orimes, plousies gunaikes. Mia apo autes ton pairnei upo ten prostasia tes. Otan omos aphenei egkuo te dekaephtakhrone kore tes, to skaei kai exaphanizetai.
Meta apo khronia oi sunthekes ton anagkazoun na epistrepsei sten Ellada, khoris na gnorizei oti molis tora arkhizoun ta pragmatika tou problemata. O skleros Toni Rent den ekhei kamia skhese me to amoustako athoo agori pou ephuge san Antones Kokkinos, ektos apo ena pragma: Kathe phora pou brekhei tou aresei na ginetai mouskema, niothontas etsi to khadi tes manas pou de gnorise pote..."Û
1961
Ena kalokairino apogeuma, skarphalomene sto dentrospito tes, eno e Lorel oneireuetai to Londino kai te lampse tou theatrou, blepei na plesiazei to spiti tous enas aproskletos episkeptes kai te metera tes na ton skotonei me to makhairi gia ten tourta me ten kokkine kordela.
2011
E Lorel einai pia diaseme ethopoios, alla panta te barainei e odunere anamnese ekeinou tou phonou. Gi' auto xanagurizei sto patriko tes ki arkhizei na xetuligei to nema mias kruphes istorias pou xekinese tote pou ta germanika aeroplana bombardizan to Londino.
Poia apeile ekrube autos o agnostos pou anagkase te metera tes na ginei phonias;"ˇ
¸Kurie Tsekhoph, sto ergo sas Oi Treis Adelphes, thetete enan problematismo. Lete mesa apo enan eroa sas, <>Agapemene mou kurie Tsekhoph, apopse tha 'thela na sas exomologetho kapoia lathe dika mou pou de tha 'thela na xanakano an eikha ten eukairia na xekineso te zoe mou apo ten arkhe...
Auto einai to oneiro tes Margiotas: na kathotan me ton agapemeno tes Tsekhoph s' ena apomero trapezaki s' ena mpar, na moirazontan ena poteri krasi kai na ta legane. Na milousan gia te zoe pou den einai para ena paikhnidi, sto opoio allote kaloumaste na paixoume khoris proba, amathoi kai abgaltoi, ki allote na paramenoume sten akre, san ethopoioi khoris rolo.
Margiota, Belgo, Anna. Treis gunaikes, treis adelphes.
Ena muthistorema gia ton erota kai ton pono, ten egkataleipse kai ten eutukhia, ola osa epanalambanontai stis zoes ton anthropon san selides theatrikou ergou pou den oloklerotheke akoma."	
